{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"board-session-science-transpiration-v2-001","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"塑料袋里的水珠从哪里来：用对照实验理解蒸腾作用","goals":["从图片中区分直接观察与科学推断","用有叶和无叶装置的差异判断水珠与叶片有关","说清水从土壤到袋内水珠的完整路径"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["observe-before-explain","controlled-comparison","one-change-per-beat","evidence-to-model"]}}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:establish-observation","purpose":"先呈现实验与问题，不提前给出蒸腾作用结论","beats":[{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:establish-observation:beat:show-experiment-and-question","narration":{"text":"先不急着解释，只看这组对照实验。左边是有叶植物，右边是无叶枝条，两边都套着透明塑料袋。我们要回答：左边袋内的水珠从哪里来？","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","kind":"image","role":"evidence","content":{"asset_id":"asset-transpiration-control-001","alt":"左侧有叶植物袋内有大量水珠，右侧无叶对照袋内近乎无水珠","regions":[{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leafy-setup","source_region":"asset-transpiration-control-001#region-leafy-setup","label":"有叶装置","confidence":"high"},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:droplets","source_region":"asset-transpiration-control-001#region-droplets","label":"袋内水珠","confidence":"high"},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leaves","source_region":"asset-transpiration-control-001#region-leaves","label":"叶片","confidence":"high"},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-setup","source_region":"asset-transpiration-control-001#region-control-setup","label":"无叶对照","confidence":"high"},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-bag","source_region":"asset-transpiration-control-001#region-control-bag","label":"近乎无水珠","confidence":"high"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"lesson-origin"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:question-card","kind":"note","role":"task","content":{"title":"① 核心问题","text":"为什么有叶装置的袋内出现很多水珠，而无叶对照几乎没有？"},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","align":"center","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:1:3","op":"board.group","group":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:group:experiment-group","title":"① 先看实验，不猜答案","role":"task","members":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:question-card"]}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:1:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:group:experiment-group"],"intent":"inspect_experiment_without_answer"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:establish-observation:beat:observe-left-droplets","narration":{"text":"先记录左边能直接看到的事实：有叶植物外的袋子内壁有大量水珠。这里只写观察，不写原因。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:2:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:droplets"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:2:2","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leaves"},"emphasis":"supporting"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:2:3","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table","kind":"table","role":"evidence","content":{"title":"② 只记录看到的现象","columns":["装置","叶片","袋内水珠"],"rows":[["左侧","有叶","很多"]]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:question-card"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:2:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table"],"intent":"record_left_observation"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:establish-observation:beat:compare-leafless-control","narration":{"text":"再看右边对照：枝条没有叶片，塑料袋内几乎没有水珠。两边条件相近，最明显的差别是有没有叶片。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:droplets"},"emphasis":"resolved"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:2","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leaves"},"emphasis":"resolved"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:3","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-setup"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:4","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-bag"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:5","op":"board.revise","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table"},"revision":{"content":{"title":"② 两个装置的直接观察","columns":["装置","叶片","袋内水珠"],"rows":[["左侧","有叶","很多"],["右侧","无叶","几乎没有"]]},"reason":"加入无叶对照的直接观察"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:3:6","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table"],"intent":"compare_control_observation"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:establish-observation:beat:infer-leaf-relationship","narration":{"text":"现在才做第一层推断：有叶时水珠多，无叶时水珠少，说明水珠的形成与叶片有关。注意，这个比较还没有直接展示水在植物内部怎样移动。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:4:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leafy-setup"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:4:2","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-setup"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:4:3","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:first-inference","kind":"note","role":"inference","content":{"title":"③ 由对照得到的推断","text":"有叶 → 水珠多；无叶 → 水珠少。因此，水珠的形成与叶片有关。","details":["这是由比较得到的推断","内部运输过程还需要科学模型解释"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:1:4:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:evidence-table","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:first-inference"],"intent":"separate_inference_from_observation"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:build-mechanism","purpose":"分三步建立植物体内水分运输与蒸腾模型","beats":[{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:build-mechanism:beat:absorb-water-through-roots","narration":{"text":"下面用科学模型解释图片看不到的内部过程。第一步，土壤中的水被根吸收，进入植物体内。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path","kind":"diagram","role":"mechanism","content":{"title":"④ 水在植物体内的路径","sequence":["土壤中的水","根吸收"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"spacious","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:first-inference"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"],"intent":"model_root_absorption"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:build-mechanism:beat:transport-water-to-leaves","narration":{"text":"第二步，水沿着茎内的导管向上运输，最后到达叶片。根吸收和茎运输把土壤里的水送到了叶子。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:2:1","op":"board.revise","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"},"revision":{"content":{"title":"④ 水在植物体内的路径","sequence":["土壤中的水","根吸收","茎内导管运输","到达叶片"]},"reason":"加入茎内运输和到达叶片"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"],"intent":"model_stem_transport"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:build-mechanism:beat:release-water-vapor","narration":{"text":"第三步，叶片上的气孔把一部分水以水蒸气的形式释放到空气中。这个过程叫蒸腾作用。水离开叶片时还是看不见的水蒸气。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:3:1","op":"board.revise","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"},"revision":{"content":{"title":"④ 植物的蒸腾作用","sequence":["土壤中的水","根吸收","茎内导管运输","到达叶片","气孔释放","水蒸气"]},"reason":"加入气孔释放水蒸气并命名蒸腾作用"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:3:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"],"intent":"name_transpiration"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:build-mechanism:beat:condense-on-bag","narration":{"text":"水蒸气碰到较凉的塑料袋内壁，会凝结成可见的小水滴。所以我们看到的水珠不是叶片直接吐出的液滴，而是水蒸气后来凝结形成的。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:4:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:condensation-path","kind":"diagram","role":"mechanism","content":{"title":"⑤ 从水蒸气到水珠","sequence":["看不见的水蒸气","碰到较凉袋壁","凝结","可见水珠"]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","align":"center","gap":"spacious","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:4:2","op":"board.connect","connection":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:connection:vapor-to-condensation","from":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"},"to":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:condensation-path"},"relation":"continues_as","label":"离开叶片以后"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:2:4:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:condensation-path"],"intent":"explain_condensation"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:test-and-organize-explanation","purpose":"回到原图检验模型，并区分证据、推断和解释","beats":[{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:test-and-organize-explanation:beat:return-to-experiment","narration":{"text":"现在用模型回看实验。有叶装置能通过许多气孔释放水蒸气，所以袋内水珠多；无叶对照缺少主要蒸腾表面，所以水珠很少。模型正好解释了两边的差异。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:1:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:leafy-setup"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:1:2","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","fragment_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image:fragment:control-setup"},"emphasis":"supporting"},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:1:3","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:model-check","kind":"note","role":"conclusion","content":{"title":"⑥ 用模型解释对照结果","items":["有叶：气孔多 → 水蒸气多 → 水珠多","无叶：主要蒸腾表面少 → 水珠少"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:1:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:experiment-image","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:model-check"],"intent":"check_model_against_image"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:test-and-organize-explanation:beat:separate-evidence-and-model","narration":{"text":"把三层信息分开：图片直接提供观察；有叶和无叶的比较支持推断；根、导管、气孔和凝结组成解释机制。好的科学解释不会把推断冒充成直接看到的事实。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:reasoning-layers","kind":"table","role":"summary","content":{"title":"⑦ 证据怎样支持解释","columns":["层次","内容","依据"],"rows":[["观察","有叶袋水珠多；无叶袋水珠少","图片直接可见"],["推断","水珠形成与叶片有关","对照比较"],["机制","根吸水→茎运输→气孔释放→凝结","科学模型"]]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"spacious","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:water-path"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:reasoning-layers"],"intent":"distinguish_evidence_inference_mechanism"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:step:test-and-organize-explanation:beat:show-complete-route","narration":{"text":"最后从头复述：先观察两个装置，再用对照发现水珠与叶片有关；接着用根吸水、茎运输、气孔释放水蒸气和袋壁凝结解释水珠。这个完整过程就是从证据走向科学模型。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:lesson-route","kind":"diagram","role":"summary","content":{"title":"⑧ 整条探究路线","sequence":["观察水珠","比较有叶/无叶","推断与叶片有关","建立蒸腾模型","解释对照结果"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"spacious","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:reasoning-layers"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:3:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:takeaway","kind":"note","role":"summary","content":{"title":"一句话结论","text":"水由根吸收，经茎运到叶片，再以水蒸气从气孔散失；水蒸气在袋壁凝结成水珠。"},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:lesson-route"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:3:3","op":"board.group","group":{"id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:group:summary-group","title":"从证据复述到模型","role":"summary","members":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:lesson-route","lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:node:takeaway"]}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:action:3:3:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-science-transpiration-v2-001:group:summary-group"],"intent":"review_evidence_to_model"}}]}}]}}
